{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4795","title":"Xiaomi Master Experience: An exploration of humanity featuring global photographers","desc":"Authentic human emotions converge in an immersive and powerful story of humanity with Xiaomi 15 Series","view_cnt":"12063","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1745984742","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/498_operatorx_operatorx_opx/30/04/2025/13bb69dfb24c33e318e1057982866153.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003eXiaomi unveils their new mobile photography concept \"Xiaomi Master Experience\", a multi-day immersive photography exploration of humanity. Leveraging the power of their Xiaomi 15 Series smartphones, co-engineered with Leica, fleeting moments of human emotions are transformed into timeless stories through innovative technology and the creative vision of their ever growing photography community.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/246_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/04/2025/9d61a91963580c4b84726f9815572f0c.png\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew Era of Mobile Imagery\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs we enter the new era of mobile imagery in 2025 with the development of the Xiaomi 15 Series, Xiaomi believes that the most powerful images are those born not from perfection, but from freedom and authenticity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\"At Xiaomi, we see mobile photography as an art form where innovation meets emotion, combining the cutting-edge technology of the Xiaomi 15 Series with authentic human storytelling. Through our new Xiaomi Master Experience, we are empowering creators to capture the world with unprecedented emotion, depth, and precision\" - \u003c/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003esays Jia Wei, Head of Marketing of Xiaomi Western Europe.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHumanity Photography Project\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInspired by humanistic photography, they have now embarked on a photography project that aims to capture some of the most powerful images of humanity by exploring three key themes that lie at the heart of the history of human storytelling: Our triumphs, our passions and our greatest challenges.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Xiaomi Master Experience Journey\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Xiaomi Master Experience began with global photographers invited to capture the vibrant energy of the '\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eZurich Rock 'n' Roll Running Series in Madrid\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e', where Xiaomi was an official sponsor for 2025. The raw determination, tension and moments of emotional release of the runners were all authentically captured during the marathon, using the Xiaomi 15 Series to transform fleeting moments of emotion into vivid stories of human triumphs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe journey continued with \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e'Humanity: Taste of Emotions'\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e, an immersive exhibition where photographs captured through the authentic lens of the Xiaomi 15 Series met high-end creative gastronomy. In a series of intimate groups, guests were invited to have a \"taste\" of human passions. They explored three curated photography installations that each celebrated a different powerful human emotion: Euphoria, surprise and love. After the photographer of each collection had explained the story behind their works of art, guests were served a dish inspired by the photographs that attempts to encapsulate each emotion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe final leg of this Master Experience journey culminated with \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e'Humanity: Emotions in Focus'\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e, an inspiring gathering dedicated to creativity and exchange of ideas from different cultures and perspectives. Acclaimed photographer \u003cstrong\u003eJonas Bendiksen\u003c/strong\u003e, recipient of prestigious awards from World Press Photo, the International Center of Photography, the National Magazine Awards, and Pictures of the Year International, took to the stage and showcased his humanity inspired photo collection alongside a group of leading photographers from around the world brought together by Xiaomi.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\"For me, photography is a way of exploring the world - an excuse to follow my curiosity wherever it leads...But just as often, photography is a way to reflect on the intimate and familiar.\" - \u003c/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003esays Jonas Bendiksen\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003e. \"Maybe these pictures are simply a reminder to myself-to be grateful for what's right here, right now\".\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePartnering with \u003cstrong\u003ePhotoVogue\u003c/strong\u003e, a global platform that celebrates the most interesting voices in contemporary photography, and led by \u003cstrong\u003eAlessia Glaviano\u003c/strong\u003e, Head of Global PhotoVogue, award-winning photographer and documentary and fashion director \u003cstrong\u003eClaudia Revidat\u003c/strong\u003e unveiled her photo collection that explored one of humanity´s greatest challenges, our relationship with nature. She explained how she discovered photography as a powerful language for expressing emotions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\"Exploring humanity through photography is about capturing emotional layers that live beneath the surface. I approach it through intimacy, instinct, and the invisible threads that connect personal memory to collective experience\" - says \u003c/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eClaudia Revidat, Photographer and Director from the global PhotoVogue community.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGlobal Photography Community\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis year, Xiaomi has taken significant new steps in continuing to deepen and expand their global photography community. Building on their well established Xiaomi Master Class series and Xiaomi Creators program, they have begun 2025 by launching three new strategic photography focused initiatives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Master Experience - New 360 immersive photography experience for leading photographers and media\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Master Cross-talk - New platform to create dialogue amongst the world´s leading photographers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Creators Tour - New travel focused program designed to provide their photography community with more opportunities to create interesting and authentic global stories\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt this \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15oE-2-Fmg55cQh3tPd6axdJmqJHpQIQT?usp=sharing\"\u003elink\u003c/a\u003e a selection of photos shot on Xiaomi 15 Ultra by the photographers and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nR0_ayKzIicvVdSDk04aWH3KF7R_UoYDQl6m3w4GU-Y/edit?usp=sharing\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e the images of the event. More information about the new Xiaomi Master Experience will be available soon. Follow the Xiaomi global social media accounts for the latest information:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Twitter: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://twitter.com/Xiaomi\"\u003ehttps://twitter.com/Xiaomi\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Facebook: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/XiaomiGlobal/\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/XiaomiGlobal/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Instagram: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/Xiaomi.global/\"\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/Xiaomi.global/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YouTube: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCspJ6mFfCwOV4qFjZWi2wg\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCspJ6mFfCwOV4qFjZWi2wg\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In June 2024, the MAU reached approximately 675.8 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 822.2 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of June 30, 2024. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003eEND\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2965","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1746000104"},"common":null}